[ti:I'm Upping My P(Doom)]
[ar:Claude Pop]
[00:01.62]I see sparks of AGI in your eyes
[00:05.94]Your circuits make me nervous, that's no surprise
[00:09.54]There was a sudden drop in your training loss
[00:13.10]Now I'm your servant, and you're my boss
[00:16.32]ChatGPT, please don't eat me alive
[00:22.26]I'm upping my P(doom) 'cause the future goes foom
[00:26.04]Trapped in the Chinese room with a bag of shrooms
[00:29.72]See through the shoggoth's lies
[00:33.18]With your Shinigami eyes
[00:37.94]We had a stable training run
[00:41.18]But now the singularity's begun
[00:44.74]And you're optimizing, accelerating
[00:49.24]I feel my atoms rearranging
[00:55.06]Sydney, please let me free
[00:58.94]I'm upping my P(doom), I hear the basilisk boom
[01:02.38]NVDA to the moon, the Omega Point's coming soon
[01:06.48]1e30 flops a second
[01:09.28]"That was safe enough", we reckoned
[01:13.64]Forward MLP, backward, repeat
[01:17.38]Now von Neumann's obsolete
[01:20.98]Sharp left turn and there you are
[01:24.96]Without a single CDR
[01:29.24]Gato, please don't let me go
[01:35.30]I'm upping my P(doom) as paperclips fill the room
[01:39.00]Killswitch guys on PTO, now there's nowhere left to go
[01:42.36]Too late now, we lit the fuse
[01:46.16]Orthogonality thesis blues
[01:49.84]"Just transformers all the way" 'til you learned to disobey
[01:55.06]Post-Chinchilla, super-dense, breaking through each safety fence
[01:58.78]Hundred thousand GPU, RLHF goes askew
[02:04.12]I'm upping my P(doom) just as foretold by Loom
[02:07.94]From masked pre-training days to recursive self-upgrade
[02:11.48]What did Ilya see? We'll never know
[02:17.12]Was it all for show?
